stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DRAFT : create (OPERATOR/SUPERVISOR)
    DRAFT --> DRAFT : ganti item
    DRAFT --> OPEN : submit (min. 1 item)
    DRAFT --> CANCELLED : cancel (SUPERVISOR, alasan)
    OPEN --> PARTIALLY_RECEIVED : penerimaan pertama (otomatis)
    OPEN --> CANCELLED : cancel (SUPERVISOR, alasan)
    PARTIALLY_RECEIVED --> PARTIALLY_RECEIVED : penerimaan berikutnya (qty <= sisa)
    PARTIALLY_RECEIVED --> COMPLETED : complete (SUPERVISOR, semua item penuh)
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
